  dialogues:
  - name: Leaifa
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: a3617e0eefa6c664baad6c9c12a69e8b, type: 3}
    sentences:
    - You really believing this guy?
  - name: Denali
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 9df70db75e70c354eb794e1e51029830, type: 3}
    sentences:
    - What do you mean?
  - name: Leaifa
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: a3617e0eefa6c664baad6c9c12a69e8b, type: 3}
    sentences:
    - "That he\u2019s from Eden? Anyone could be making that up."
  - name: Denali
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 9df70db75e70c354eb794e1e51029830, type: 3}
    sentences:
    - Maybe, but if he is telling the truth, this will be our best chance for a better
      life.
    - Besides, if he is lying, grandma will see right through him.
  - name: Leaifa
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: a3617e0eefa6c664baad6c9c12a69e8b, type: 3}
    sentences:
    - She sure can be terryfing.
